'''Amposta''' (from {{Langx|ar|المبوسطة|al-mabūṣṭa|the hidden}}), is a [[Communes of Balisca|commune]] in the region of [[Luzamontaña]] in [[Araucaria]]. The city is situated on [[Salto Bay]] among the foothills of the [[Matarrañya|Matarrañya / Cañadapirén]]. 

As a result of the growth of the [[Castejón Metropolis]], Amposta is now considered to be a {{W|satellite city}} of Castejón, and is included in the [[Concordia|Concordia conurbation]]. Redevelopment of the waterfront and the construction of residential high-rises beginning in the 2020s has made the city one fastest growing in Balisca.

